      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Requests that location-sensitive information be included in network capabilities. Prior to Android 12, this information is always returned to apps holding the appropriate permission, possibly noting that the app has used location.</para>
          <para>On Android 12 and later, location-sensitive information is normally removed from callback objects unless this flag is set. For compatibility, the system may still include the owner UID of a Wi-Fi suggestion for an app targeting Android 11 or lower if it has location permission. When this flag is set, the system checks location permission and the location toggle state, and notes location usage if location information is returned. Use this flag to request location-sensitive data in network capabilities sent via <see cref="M:Android.Net.ConnectivityManager.NetworkCallback.OnCapabilitiesChanged(Android.Net.Network,Android.Net.NetworkCapabilities)" />.</para>
          <para>Location-sensitive data includes some <see cref="P:Android.Net.NetworkCapabilities.TransportInfo" /> values, such as <see cref="T:Android.Net.Wifi.WifiInfo" />, and <see cref="P:Android.Net.NetworkCapabilities.OwnerUid" /> for apps using <see cref="T:Android.Net.Wifi.WifiNetworkSuggestion" />.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/net/ConnectivityManager.NetworkCallback#FLAG_INCLUDE_LOCATION_INFO" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.net.ConnectivityManager.NetworkCallback.FLAG_INCLUDE_LOCATION_INFO</code>.</a></format></para>
          <para>Portions of this page are modifications based on work created and shared by the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/site-policies" title="Android Open Source Project">Android Open Source Project</a></format> and used according to terms described in the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.5/" title="Creative Commons 2.5 Attribution License">Creative Commons 2.5 Attribution License.</a></format></para>
        </summary>
      </Docs>
